Incomplete and failed streams retain reported usage; terminal events
retain provider stop evidence. Upstream handles max_tokens usage.
Regression: apps/api/src/lib/tanstack-ai-provider-wire.test.ts.

Retain native thinking controls for catalog models and adaptive thinking without
forced effort. Portable reasoning takes precedence; forced-tool finalization
strips both paths. Remove this extension when upstream can express these native
request shapes through its public API.


Retain provider stop evidence through SDK 1.0 terminal wrappers and preserve upstream response identity/refusal detail. Published ESM and TypeScript stop handling remain aligned.

